      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "Understanding Economic Data and Its Role",
          "box": {
            "x": 612648,
            "y": 1114923,
            "cx": 4621553,
            "cy": 1360728
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Economic data reflects the health and trends of an economy.\\nIt includes indicators like GDP, inflation, employment, and trade balances.\\nInvestment professionals rely on economic data to make informed decisions.\\nTimely economic data helps anticipate market movements and risks.\\nAccurate data supports policymakers in designing effective economic policies.",
          "box": {
            "x": 612648,
            "y": 2584058,
            "cx": 4621553,
            "cy": 3159018
          }
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "assets/media/image2.jpeg",
          "box": {
            "x": 5691261,
            "y": 1480640,
            "cx": 5837780,
            "cy": 3896719
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slide": 3,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "Economic Data Impact on Financial Markets",
          "box": {
            "x": 612648,
            "y": 1114923,
            "cx": 4621553,
            "cy": 1360728
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Market prices often react quickly to new economic data releases.\\nData on employment, inflation, and interest rates influence asset valuations.\\nEconomic data drives currency fluctuations and bond market movements.\\nTraders use economic reports to adjust portfolio risk and allocations.\\nReliable data reduces uncertainty and improves market confidence.",
          "box": {
            "x": 612648,
            "y": 2584058,
            "cx": 4621553,
            "cy": 3159018
          }
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "assets/media/image3.jpeg",
          "box": {
            "x": 5691261,
            "y": 1480640,
            "cx": 5837780,
            "cy": 3896719
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slide": 4,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "Utilizing Economic Data for Strategic Planning",
          "box": {
            "x": 612648,
            "y": 603504,
            "cx": 4361686,
            "cy": 1527048
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Businesses use economic data for forecasting demand and supply trends.\\nEconomic indicators guide investment timing and resource allocation.\\nData-driven insights improve risk management and competitive advantage.\\nLong-term economic data helps identify growth sectors and challenges.\\nIntegrating economic data enhances decision-making across industries.",
          "box": {
            "x": 612647,
            "y": 2212848,
            "cx": 4361687,
            "cy": 4096512
          }
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "assets/media/image4.jpeg",
          "box": {
            "x": 5818632,
            "y": -1,
