      "images": []
    },
    {
      "slide": 6,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "Deliverable- PowerPoint Presentation to be delivered in class\\n1. Executive Summary (1-2 pages)\\nCurrent economic overview\\nKey strengths and vulnerabilities\\nInvestment implications\\n2. Data Visualization Dashboard - each of the 5 key categories\\nMacroeconomic Fundamentals\\nFiscal and Monetary Policy\\nExchange Rate\\nLabor Market and Social Indicators\\nFinancial Markets and Banking\\nKey Questions to Address\\nHow has Your Assigned Country's economic recovery progressed post-COVID?\\nWhat are the primary drivers of current inflation trends?\\nHow is the performance of Your Assigned Country\u2019s financial markets over the last 5 years?\\nWhat additional information did you learn during your analysis?\\nRubic Success Metrics\\nComprehensive coverage and delivery of required economic indicators\\nClear identification of trends and inflection points\\nProfessional presentation of findings\\nEffective use of FactSet tools and data",
